----------------------
This repository does not contain Beckhoff or Microsoft software. The iecode CLI
drives TwinCAT XAE, TcXaeShell, EnvDTE and the TwinCAT Automation Interface through
COM late binding and uses the copies installed and licensed on the user's machine;
no interop assemblies are shipped.

The iecode CLI depends on these NuGet packages, which are bundled into its release
artifacts:
